      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[. . .] let your &ldquo;<i>house</i>&rdquo; (i.e., wife) and the &ldquo;<i>house</i>&rdquo; (wife) of the <i>beadle</i> Sulaym\u0101n collect</li>\n<li>&ndash;3. from the women. In addition, you alone should make the collection. Exert yourself in this. Whatever is</li>\n<li></li>\n<li>obt[ained] from everyone, keep with you until we inform you</li>\n<li>what to do. We know about this matter</li>\n<li>only from you. Do not make it necessary for us to reprove you.</li>\n<li>Beware of being disobedient. May God the ex(alted) be</li>\n<li>your succor, and <i>may you be inscribed in the book of [lif]e, the book</i></li>\n<li><i>of remembrance. And peace.</i></li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
